WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:14.707
Miss Gray: Daisy, you're not listening very well today.

2
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:18.950
Daisy: I know. But my dance show is coming up.

3
00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:22.274
Daisy: And I love to dance!

4
00:00:22.275 --> 00:00:24.271
Miss Gray: I'm glad about that.

5
00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:27.347
Miss Gray: But we're studying science right now.

6
00:00:27.348 --> 00:00:30.136
Miss Gray: And I don't think you've been working very hard.

7
00:00:30.137 --> 00:00:37.900
Daisy: Sorry, Miss Gray.

8
00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:39.792
Mr. Gomez: Hi, Daisy!

9
00:00:39.793 --> 00:00:41.478
Daisy: Hi, Dad.

10
00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:43.678
Mr. Gomez: How was school?

11
00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:49.016
Daisy: Bad. Miss Gray got really mad at me today.

12
00:00:49.017 --> 00:00:50.556
Mr. Gomez: Why?

13
00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:54.282
Daisy: I was talking and dancing during science.

14
00:00:54.283 --> 00:00:57.799
Mr. Gomez: That doesn't sound like you, Daisy.

15
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.467
Mr. Gomez: You usually listen very well.

16
00:01:01.468 --> 00:01:04.962
Daisy: I know. I couldn't help it today.

17
00:01:04.963 --> 00:01:08.485
Daisy: I just kept thinking about my dance show.

18
00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:12.965
Mr. Gomez: Maybe you can find a way to say sorry.

19
00:01:12.966 --> 00:01:15.821
Daisy: Hmm. I'll think about that.

20
00:01:15.822 --> 00:01:19.340
Daisy: Can I go to Jenna's house for a little while?

21
00:01:19.341 --> 00:01:29.469
Mr. Gomez: Sure. Just be back by six o'clock for dinner.

22
00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:35.868
Daisy: Hi, Jenna. What are you making?

23
00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:38.939
Jenna: Paper flowers for my mom.

24
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.314
Jenna: Want to make some for your mother?

25
00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:58.471
Daisy: Okay. Hey! I have a good idea!

26
00:01:58.472 --> 00:02:01.856
Kara: Who are the flowers for, Daisy?

27
00:02:01.857 --> 00:02:05.038
Daisy: Miss Gray.

28
00:02:05.039 --> 00:02:07.590
Maya: They're pretty.

29
00:02:07.591 --> 00:02:13.080
Daisy: Thanks. I hope Miss Gray likes them.

30
00:02:13.081 --> 00:02:17.736
Jenna: She will.

31
00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:24.943
Coby: Oh no.

32
00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:28.279
Greg: Who's that?

33
00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:32.135
Mrs. Dee: Good morning, boys and girls.

34
00:02:32.136 --> 00:02:34.342
Mrs. Dee: I'm Mrs. Dee.

35
00:02:34.343 --> 00:02:42.383
I'll be your teacher in Room Two today!
